# UC10-紧急识别用例图

flowchart LR
    actor "用户" as User
    rectangle "紧急模块" as Emergency {
        card "输入内容" as C1
        card "关键词检测" as C2
        card "紧急判断" as C3
        card "显示警告" as C4
        card "添加声明" as C5
    }

    User --> C1
    C1 --> C2
    C2 --> C3
    C3 -->|紧急| C4
    C3 -->|正常| C1
    C4 --> C5